// A * B
Input
Store A
Input
Store B

Load B
SkipCond 000
Jump positivo

Load zero
Subt A
Store A

Load zero
Subt B
Store B

positivo, Load B
SkipCond 800
Jump done

loop, Load total
Add A
Store total
Load B
Subt uno
Store B
SkipCond 400
Jump loop

done, Load total
Output
Halt

A, DEC 0
B, DEC 0
total, DEC 0
uno, DEC 1
zero, DEC 0